+## OQ-copy-email-address-retention
+**Is the email address for the copy kept after the copy has been sent? Is it recorded for HR?**
+
+No receiving party needs the address. Keeping it would collect personal data that no party needs (data minimisation, G-01).
+
+Options:
+- Use it only to send the copy and do not keep it
+- Keep it and record it for HR
+
+**Recommendation:** Use it only to send the copy and do not keep it. Confirm with the product owner.
+
