+# US-08.5 – Send the employee a copy of their submitted answers
+
+Part of [Employee onboarding questionnaire](../feature.md), section [8. Completing and submitting the questionnaire](../feature.md#SEC-08-completion-and-submission).
+
+**As** new employee, **I want** to choose, when I submit the questionnaire, to be sent an email with a copy of the answers I submitted, to an email address I type in, **so that** I keep a record of what I entered and do not need to call HR to ask (today new employees keep calling HR about what they entered)
+
+Priority **P2** – HR asked for it to reduce recurring calls from new employees; it is optional, a convenience, and blocks no registration. · Status: **inferred** · Sources: F-hr_email_copy-37cede, F-hr_email_copy-addeef, F-hr_email_copy-6d2b5a, F-hr_email_copy-77a561, F-hr_email_copy-029105, F-hr_email_copy-b67d2f, F-hr_email_copy-ab2538, G-01, G-10
+
+> ⚠ Open questions affecting this section: [OQ-copy-email-address-retention](../open-questions.md#oq-copy-email-address-retention)
+Covers (details in [the section](../feature.md#SEC-08-completion-and-submission) and [information.md](../information.md)): Send me a copy of my answers, Email address for the copy, Copy of the submitted answers
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- **AC-08.5.1 Copy offered at submission and optional**
+  - **Given** an employee at the end of the questionnaire, when submitting (after the permit reminder, where it is shown)
+  - **When** they are about to submit
+  - **Then** Lonio offers to send them a copy of their answers (yes or no); the employee may leave it unanswered and can still submit, and without a 'yes' no copy is sent
+  - _Sources: F-hr_email_copy-37cede, F-hr_email_copy-addeef, G-10_
+
+  | Example | Country (home address) | Nationality | → | Send me a copy of my answers | Checked |
+  |---|---|---|---|---|---|
+  | Every employee is offered the copy (illustrative) | Switzerland | Switzerland | → | optional | ✅ |
+
+- **AC-08.5.2 Email address asked only when a copy is wanted**
+  - **Given** an employee at submission
+  - **When** they answer whether they want a copy
+  - **Then** if they answer 'yes', they type in the email address the copy should go to, and it must be given; if they answer 'no' or leave the question empty, no email address is asked
+  - _Sources: F-hr_email_copy-029105, F-hr_email_copy-b67d2f, F-hr_email_copy-addeef_
+
+  | Example | Send me a copy of my answers | → | Email address for the copy | Checked |
+  |---|---|---|---|---|
+  | Employee wants a copy (illustrative) | yes | → | required | ✅ |
+  | Employee does not want a copy (illustrative) | no | → | not asked | ✅ |
+
+- **AC-08.5.3 Copy shows the submitted answers exactly, nothing more**
+  - **Given** an employee who answered 'yes' and typed in an email address
+  - **When** they submit the questionnaire
+  - **Then** an email is sent to that address showing the answers exactly as they were submitted (only the answers recorded on submission), with nothing more: no derived results such as the insurance start date, the source tax liability or the tariff code, and no other content. If the employee answered 'no' or left the question empty, no copy is sent
+  - _Sources: F-hr_email_copy-37cede, F-hr_email_copy-029105, F-hr_email_copy-ab2538, F-hr_email_copy-addeef, D-036_
+
+  | Example | Send me a copy of my answers | Email address for the copy | Country (home address) | → | Copy of the submitted answers | Checked |
+  |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+  | Copy wanted, address given (illustrative) | yes | new.employee@example.com | – | → | yes | ✅ |
+  | Copy not wanted (illustrative) | no | – | – | → | no | ✅ |
+  | Copy question left empty (illustrative) | – | – | Switzerland | → | no | ✅ |
+
+- **AC-08.5.4 Email address used only to send the copy**
+  - **Given** an employee who typed in an email address for the copy
+  - **When** the questionnaire is submitted and the copy is sent
+  - **Then** the address is used only to send the copy; it is not recorded for the pension fund or for source tax. Whether it is kept afterwards or recorded for HR is open (see OQ-copy-email-address-retention)
+  - _Sources: F-hr_email_copy-77a561, F-hr_email_copy-029105, G-01_
+_Trace check: partial – AC-08.5.1 places the offer after the permit reminder, which none of the cited facts support._
+
+
